## The Key Difference

|Aspect               |Manual (Way 1)                 |Automated (Way 2)               |
|---------------------|-------------------------------|--------------------------------|
|**How to start**     |Type in Copilot Chat           |GitHub Actions runs on schedule |
|**Human involvement**|You watch & manage             |Mostly automated                |
|**Boundary gate**    |You stop, read, ratify manually|Workflow pauses, emails you     |
|**Extraction**       |You watch progress             |Runs overnight, emails when done|
|**Speed**            |Same                           |Same (but overnight)            |
|**Best for**         |Learning, first-time           |Production, repeated runs       |

